      "description": "- REVOCATION_REASON_USER_REQUEST: User-initiated\n - REVOCATION_REASON_FRAUD_DETECTED: Fraud slash\n - REVOCATION_REASON_CS_BELOW_THRESHOLD: CS dropped below minimum\n - REVOCATION_REASON_IR_INVALIDATED: Required IR was invalidated\n - REVOCATION_REASON_EXPIRED: Natural expiration\n - REVOCATION_REASON_GOVERNANCE: Governance decision\n - REVOCATION_REASON_SECURITY_COMPROMISE: Security incident\n - REVOCATION_REASON_POLICY_CHANGE: Policy deprecated",
      "title": "RevocationReason represents why a VC was revoked"
    },
