      "description": "- VC_TYPE_VERIFIED_HUMAN: Core credentials\n\nVC:isVerifiedHuman\n - VC_TYPE_AGE_OVER_18: VC:isAgeOver18\n - VC_TYPE_AGE_OVER_21: VC:isAgeOver21\n - VC_TYPE_RESIDENT_OF: VC:isResidentOf\n - VC_TYPE_BIOMETRIC_AUTH: VC:hasBiometricAuth\n - VC_TYPE_KYC_VERIFICATION: VC:hasKYCVerification\n - VC_TYPE_NOTARY_PUBLIC: VC:isNotaryPublic\n - VC_TYPE_PROFESSIONAL_LICENSE: VC:isProfessionalLicense\n - VC_TYPE_BIOMETRIC_FOCUS: Arena focus credentials\n\nVC:BiometricFocus\n - VC_TYPE_SOCIAL_FOCUS: VC:SocialFocus\n - VC_TYPE_GEOLOCATION_FOCUS: VC:GeoLocationFocus\n - VC_TYPE_HIGH_ASSURANCE_FOCUS: VC:HighAssuranceFocus\n - VC_TYPE_POSSESSION_FOCUS: VC:PossessionFocus\n - VC_TYPE_KNOWLEDGE_FOCUS: VC:KnowledgeFocus\n - VC_TYPE_PERSISTENCE_FOCUS: VC:PersistenceFocus\n - VC_TYPE_SPECIALIZED_FOCUS: VC:SpecializedFocus\n - VC_TYPE_CUSTOM: Custom (governance-defined)\n\nCustom VC types start at 100",
